{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/5d3966a116def60c13ef49928e467b67.poster.avif?t=1773903962\" width=900 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/5d3966a116def60c13ef49928e467b67.webm?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/5d3966a116def60c13ef49928e467b67.mp4?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrink down and reimagine your desk as a whimsical world in Animula Nook, a cozy miniature life sim. Craft your homes from odds and ends, grow giant crops, style your OOTD, and explore the enchanting Wupa Woods. Just remember, Minies are always by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/8642c10e71b9fd80710dfd454dec9fa6.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1375 height=176 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/a21c92c71ad066940e4ba47c787cc32b.poster.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/a21c92c71ad066940e4ba47c787cc32b.webm?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/a21c92c71ad066940e4ba47c787cc32b.mp4?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Use your shrink gun to miniaturize desk clutter into building materials! Craft a house from chocolate bars, turn a glasses case into a sofa, or make rooftops from bottle caps. Everything in Starside Homestead is yours to create\u2014what will you make next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/2f083af3b97f9e0302c3c40a4daa286c.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1319 height=145 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/15ef16078bbab3059746aba067ef35a3.poster.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/15ef16078bbab3059746aba067ef35a3.webm?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/15ef16078bbab3059746aba067ef35a3.mp4?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Bloom your balcony into a lush planting paradise. Plant tiny seeds and watch them grow into giant roses. And when you\u2019re tired, just let the petals hold you gently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/35236b75f5c508360230ebb76dc36cd9.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1212 height=159 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/401cce10e52658c4c88aae4ac25ef89c.poster.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/401cce10e52658c4c88aae4ac25ef89c.webm?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/401cce10e52658c4c88aae4ac25ef89c.mp4?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your OOTD to kickstart a brand-new day, and dress up Minies and friends in outfits you\u2019ve prepared for them. Every new look is a little spark of joy you share with Minietopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/5e7a5fd3c7878bda721585381fa2e9a3.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1560 height=154 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/e2bf632f3f9fa8aaa7e24b123ffd6fe9.poster.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/e2bf632f3f9fa8aaa7e24b123ffd6fe9.webm?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/e2bf632f3f9fa8aaa7e24b123ffd6fe9.mp4?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab Wupa\u2019s tail and journey through the enchanting Wupa Woods, discovering the vibrant Floral Sea and the mysterious Tunnel in the Woods. Bottle the sun, brew the dew, and pluck the lucky four-leaf clover to let its fortune guide your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/e1a8faf43946fe55df22fb831b04c367.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1385 height=168 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/fb82f0b6610046fc76eb7aa6d7bd9762.poster.avif?t=1773903962\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/fb82f0b6610046fc76eb7aa6d7bd9762.webm?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/fb82f0b6610046fc76eb7aa6d7bd9762.mp4?t=1773903962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Meet unique Minies, invite them home, and share a life filled with music, dance, and laughter. With 8 instruments to play, you can form a little band and let melodies weave your moments together\u2014the best memories are the ones you share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767320?t=1773903962","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/541e8b5987dcb400d4e4115453af6ca6891704b2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773903962","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/b339c6cc3b248a7434dd3a7a53f61c2bb22cc699/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773903962","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/b339c6cc3b248a7434dd3a7a53f61c2bb22cc699/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773903962","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/4a2bc7203dbea6d125f99680424101ea.avif?t=1773903962\" width=780 height=146 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767320/extras/5d3966a116def60c13ef49928e467b67.poster.avif?t=1773903962\" width=900 height=500 ><source